  "description": "Windows Credential Manager provider for OutWit.Shared.Secrets. Generic credentials via advapi32 (LibraryImport, NativeAOT-clean), in the vault of the account the process runs as: an interactive user cannot read a service's credential, and vice versa. Register at the composition root; entries appear in Credential Manager → Windows Credentials → Generic Credentials under \"{key}#{hash}\".",
